            <button class="record-result-btn w-full bg-[#0c1b3a] hover:bg-[#163561] text-white font-900 text-sm py-3 rounded cursor-pointer transition-all uppercase tracking-wider" data-pid="${p.id}">
              Record Pilot Result →
